# Patterns DVC skips. NEVER list a DVC-managed output root here: a tracked
# output under an ignored path makes every repo-wide walk (`dvc status`,
# `dvc gc --workspace`) fail with "Path ... is ignored by .dvcignore", and the
# declared roots (config/paths.yaml dvc_output_root_keys: results/,
# training_results/, artifacts/embeddings/, logs/, training_profile/,
# artifacts/abl_opt/, wandb/, data/laya/) are exactly what DVC tracks.
# This file therefore only keeps DVC's walks away from trees it will never
# track.
.venv/
.dvc-cache/
.dvc-site-cache/
node_modules/
graphify-out/
archify/
matplotlib/
# DVC's OWN operation scratch (an ad-hoc `dvc add/push/gc ... > logs/dvc_*.log`):
# never a payload of any tracked root, so it must not disturb a root's snapshot.
logs/dvc_*.log
